[{"answer":"Hi. Can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to find out if you have any excursions suitable for families.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/3.mp3"},{"answer":"How about taking your family for a cruise?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/4.mp3"},{"answer":"We have a steamship that takes passengers out several times a day -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/5.mp3"},{"answer":"it's over 100 years old.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/6.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/7.mp3"},{"answer":"How long is the trip?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/8.mp3"},{"answer":"About an hour and a half.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/9.mp3"},{"answer":"And don't forget to take pictures of the mountains.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/10.mp3"},{"answer":"They're all around you when you're on the boat and they look fantastic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/11.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/12.mp3"},{"answer":"And I assume there's a café or something on board?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. How old are your children?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, my daughter's fifteen and my son's seven.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there are various things you can do once you've crossed the lake, to make a day of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/17.mp3"},{"answer":"One thing that's very popular is a visit to the Country Farm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/18.mp3"},{"answer":"You're met off the boat by the farmer and he'll take you to the holding pens, where the sheep are kept.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Children love feeding them!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/20.mp3"},{"answer":"My son would love that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/21.mp3"},{"answer":"He really likes animals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there's also a 40-minute trek round the farm on a horse, if he wants.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think he'd manage it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/24.mp3"},{"answer":"He hasn't done that before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. It's suitable for complete beginners.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/27.mp3"},{"answer":"And again, visitors are welcome to explore the farm on their own,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/28.mp3"},{"answer":"as long as they take care to close gates and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/29.mp3"},{"answer":"There are some very beautiful gardens along the side of the lake which also belong to the farm -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/30.mp3"},{"answer":"they'll be just at their best now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/31.mp3"},{"answer":"You could easily spend an hour or two there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/32.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Well that all sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And can we get lunch there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/34.mp3"},{"answer":"You can, and it's very good, though it's not included in the basic cost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/35.mp3"},{"answer":"You pay when you get there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/37.mp3"},{"answer":"So is there anything else to do over on that side of the lake?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, what you can do is take a bike over on the ship and then go on a cycling trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/39.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a trail there called the Back Road -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/40.mp3"},{"answer":"you could easily spend three or four hours exploring it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/41.mp3"},{"answer":"and the scenery's wonderful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/42.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll give you a map when you get your ticket for the cruise -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/43.mp3"},{"answer":"there's no extra charge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/44.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the trail like in terms of difficulty?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Quite challenging in places.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/46.mp3"},{"answer":"It wouldn't be suitable for your seven-year-old.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/47.mp3"},{"answer":"It needs someone who's got a bit more experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, my daughter loves cycling and so do I, so maybe the two of us could go,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/49.mp3"},{"answer":"and my wife and son could stay on the farm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/50.mp3"},{"answer":"That might work out quite well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/51.mp3"},{"answer":"But we don't have bikes here...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/52.mp3"},{"answer":"is there somewhere we could rent them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there's a place here in the city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/54.mp3"},{"answer":"It's called Ratchesons.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll just make a note of that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/56.mp3"},{"answer":"er, how do you spell it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/57.mp3"},{"answer":"RATCHESONS.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just by the cruise ship terminal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/59.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/60.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd also need to pick up a repair kit for the bike from there to take along with you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/61.mp3"},{"answer":"and you'd need to take along a snack and some water -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/62.mp3"},{"answer":"it'd be best to get those in the city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/64.mp3"},{"answer":"That shouldn't be a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/65.mp3"},{"answer":"And I assume I can rent a helmet from the bike place?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, you should definitely get that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/67.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a great ride, but you want to be well prepared because it's very remote -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/68.mp3"},{"answer":"you won't see any shops round there, or anywhere to stay,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/69.mp3"},{"answer":"so you need to get back in time for the last boat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. So what sort of prices are we looking at here?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see, that'd be one adult and one child for the cruise with farm tour,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/72.mp3"},{"answer":"that's $117","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/73.mp3"},{"answer":"and an adult and a child for the cruise only so that's $214 altogether.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, wait a minute,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/75.mp3"},{"answer":"how old did you say your daughter was?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Fifteen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Then I'm afraid it's $267","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/78.mp3"},{"answer":"because she has to pay the adult fare, which is $75","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/79.mp3"},{"answer":"instead of the child fare which is $22.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/81.mp3"},{"answer":"That's OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-1-part-1-2023-04-18-00-17-11/82.mp3"}]
